The scene: a 24-segment rope lying in an S-like curve. Task: reshape it into the target U-shaped curve shown in the state/observation.

Interface (budget 200 calls; move/grab/release/observe each cost 1, state is free):
- `.venv/bin/python robot_rope.py state` -- print scene state as JSON (effector position, rope node coordinates, goal, budget).
- `.venv/bin/python robot_rope.py observe` -- render a top-down PNG of the scene.
